{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Blightened</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken into a world shattered by time. In <strong>Blightened</strong>, corruption is both your curse and your only way to fight back. Wield volatile blight to fuel abilities, survive collapsing ruptures, and carve through guardians that exist outside of reason and memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Genre Tags:</strong>\u00a0#Metroidvania\u00a0 #2.5D Action Platformer #Dark Fantasy</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blight-Fueled Abilities</strong> <br>Absorb corruption from enemies and the world itself. Use it to heal, empower your attacks, and unlock devastating abilities. Carrying too much makes the energy unstable and dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/f19c8a03dc4b50d621d93a0a829d3209.poster.avif?t=1773251341\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/f19c8a03dc4b50d621d93a0a829d3209.webm?t=1773251341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/f19c8a03dc4b50d621d93a0a829d3209.mp4?t=1773251341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fractured Ruptures</strong> <br>Explore collapsing timelines where landscapes twist, mutate, and rebuild with each cycle. Every rupture is a battle against enemies and the instability of reality itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/9524bfb759e27c72ba709a6e31ddb196.poster.avif?t=1773251341\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/9524bfb759e27c72ba709a6e31ddb196.webm?t=1773251341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Syphon</strong> <br>Store and refine blight in an ancient machine. Upgrade your health, abilities, and capacity, or withdraw corruption to carry into the next battle. Every decision shapes your survival strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/87718e19e966439a4c5ec6689cc41df3.poster.avif?t=1773251341\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/87718e19e966439a4c5ec6689cc41df3.webm?t=1773251341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Biomes</strong> <br>Journey through frozen sanctuaries, druid construction sites, fungal swamps, volcanic prisons, and war-torn graveyards. Each biome is a fragment of a broken world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/d7c41ec6e5ba00be045f7e8729fa54a3.poster.avif?t=1773251341\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/d7c41ec6e5ba00be045f7e8729fa54a3.webm?t=1773251341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/d7c41ec6e5ba00be045f7e8729fa54a3.mp4?t=1773251341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https: