ebuild with each cycle. Every rupture is a battle against enemies and the instability of reality itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/9524bfb759e27c72ba709a6e31ddb196.poster.avif?t=1773251341\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/9524bfb759e27c72ba709a6e31ddb196.webm?t=1773251341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Syphon</strong> <br>Store and refine blight in an ancient machine. Upgrade your health, abilities, and capacity, or withdraw corruption to carry into the next battle. Every decision shapes your survival strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/87718e19e966439a4c5ec6689cc41df3.poster.avif?t=1773251341\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/87718e19e966439a4c5ec6689cc41df3.webm?t=1773251341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Biomes</strong> <br>Journey through frozen sanctuaries, druid construction sites, fungal swamps, volcanic prisons, and war-torn graveyards. Each biome is a fragment of a broken world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/d7c41ec6e5ba00be045f7e8729fa54a3.poster.avif?t=1773251341\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/d7c41e